This Amendment No.1 to Contract No.5963 Use Agreement ("Amendment") is made between
the City of Cheyenne, WY(the“City")and Level3 Communications, LLC ("Level 3")and is
effective this
day of
,2013(Effective Date").
WHEREAS, Level 3 entered intoa Use Agreement with the City on or about February
25,2013, identified as Use Agreement Contract No.5963 (*Use Agreement"), for limited use of
the public right-of-way for the installation of afiber optic communications systems andtoset a
fee for that use; and
WHEREAS, the parties now wish to amend the Use Agreement under the terms and
conditions contained herein to correct an error in the length of the linearfeet of cable described
in the Use Agreement on which the fee is based.
AMENDMENT
In consideration of the mutual covenants contained herein, the parties hereby agree to amend the
Use Agreement as follows:
1.The number“16,453"in the second line of Section 5 is deleted and replaced with the
number“13,656.52."
Except as amended herein, all other terms and provisions of the Use Agreement shall
continue in full force and effect and may not be further amended unless by written instrument
signed by the parties.
3.This Amendment may be executed by the parties in one or more counterparts each of
which when so executed shall be an original, but all such counterparts shall constitute one and
the same instrument.
4.
Upon execution, this Amendment shall be a binding obligation of the parties and is
incorporated into the Use Agreement.
